{
  "name": "hp-low-health-edge",
  "why": "The low-health threshold is strict: a hit to exactly 15 says nothing, the hit to 11 crosses. A zero-damage resend while the line waits does not restart its quiet time, so the line goes out HURT_DEBOUNCE_MS after the crossing.",
  "source": "app/test/engine.test.mjs low-health tests (A17.2, F57, F375); app/src/engine.js `_hurtLineArm` and `_hurtLineTry`",
  "runners": ["engine","stage"],
  "setup": {
    "delay": "timers",
    "fields": ["moment"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {"advance_ms":10},
    {"advance_ms":3000},
    {"check":"live","preamble":true},
    {"frames":["$HIR,4,0,19,2,100,0,3,*","$HP,15,0,0,*"]},
    {"check":"exactly_15"},
    {"advance_ms":1000},
    {"frames":["$HIR,4,0,19,2,4,0,3,*","$HP,11,0,0,*"]},
    {"advance_ms":250},
    {"frame":"$HP,11,0,0,*"},
    {"advance_ms":250},
    {"check":"alert_on_time"}
  ],
  "stage_ignores": [
    {"what":"write:$PLAY,,4,6,VAE","at":"exactly_15","why":"Engine preamble (F478): on its late MC start the engine's divergence poll is answered by the unspawned gun's `$HP,0,0,0`; B5 holds it, the `$LCD` that follows restores the pools but not the previous pools, and the `$HP` 2.5 s in reads as an armour rise, so the engine plays `armour_up` (VA1G, 1.2 s) inside the preamble. The stage's SPAWN has no such poll. That clip still sounds at this hit, so the engine drops the grunt (PAIN_STALE_MS) where the stage plays it."},
    {"what":"write:$GLED","why":"Harness timing: the stage's gun-body readout animation runs on its injected `sleep`, which is instant in this runner, while the engine's runs on its tick clock, so the same frames land at different checkpoints."},
    {"what":"state.moment","why":"The stage has no HUD moment slot to expose as state (its `_moment` is an internal gate); the HUD reads the engine's."},
    {"what":"state.deaths","why":"The stage keeps no death count (MC and the HUD read the engine's); `alive` is compared instead."},
    {"what":"state.phase","why":"The stage has no MC link, so it has no match phase; it is armed and spawned by its own buttons."}
  ],
